    "title": "Dancing Tiles",
    "description": "Feel the beat and experience the exciting music rhythm game! Enjoy various genres of music, from Piano, Pop, Anime, Hip-hop to Rock and EDM masterpieces.\r\n\r\nDancing Tiles Features:\r\n- 1000+ songs, original, classic, vocaloid and all the style to satisfy every music taste\r\n- Simple tap control experiences but coolest game showed\r\n- Appealing, modern graphics instead of black and white notes\r\n- A wide variety of scenes and items to choose from\r\n- High quality music source and musical score makes you feel like in a concert\r\n- Breath-taking rhythm will challenge your hand speed limit",
